out.push(stage('4R', 'Report – sample'));
out.push(p('_**My register has nine rows and five acts, with four owners. The row I am least sure of is clause 6, because nobody has ever read a gauge at both ends and I do not know whether the drivers will. The evidence column is empty on one row.**_'));
out.push(p('⚠ **The follow-up question is the one that produces the lesson.** ⚠ **Of each empty evidence cell: is the thing not being done, or being done invisibly?** **Most people cannot say** — ⚠ **and that inability is itself the answer, because an obligation whose state you cannot determine from your own records is one you cannot prove you performed.**'));
out.push(stage('5', 'Read'));
out.push(p('**1**  ⚠ *This register does not bind anybody.* ⚠ **It is first because the first reaction of a named owner is that they have been made to promise something** — **and nine words at the top prevent a week of that.** **The company is bound by the agreement and cannot delegate that; the register allocates performance.**'));
out.push(p('**2**  ⚠ **Evidenced · being done and leaving no trace · not being done at all.** ⚠ **The middle two look identical from a desk** — **and they are completely different from a tribunal, where one is an obligation performed and the other is an obligation that cannot be shown to have been performed, which on the only day it matters is the same as not doing it.**'));
out.push(p('**3**  ⚠ **Because a name beside a clause number reads as a personal undertaking.** ⚠ **Nine of the eleven owners and deputies had not seen the agreement** — **so the clause number lives in the author\'s column and the owner\'s row says what somebody does on a day.**'));
out.push(stage('6', 'Write with help – sample (176 words)'));
